   573	    - Temporarily close the mouth, flood-fill the reachable interior background from the seed,
   574	      then reopen the mouth and extend its full width straight outward to the grid edge.
   575	    - The outgoing strip keeps that mouth width at every depth, and its colors follow a periodic
